   164	### C4 (high). No independent verifier or full call validation exists for this chain. Tasks 5.1, 2.5. (Found by Astra; verified.)
   165	
   166	SRC-010 and task 5.1 name `verify_chain` (`D/requirements.md:32`; `D/tasks.md:77`). The example of
   167	that name verifies the retired A102/A80 chain (`verify_chain.rs:89,134`). The GP harness keeps
   168	only the final node proof and calls `VerifierKey::verify` (`sherlock_gp.rs:289-291,330-341`). The
