   134	## 4. Assurance summary
   135	
   136	See `assurance.md`. The chain source -> image -> reference steps -> witness -> leaf -> node/decider -> ledger has one evidence class per link; no class substitutes for another (UISEC-012). Completeness and soundness per rule are stated obligations. Dispatch coverage is by complete dispatch-predicate partition plus directed cases, not by sample (ISSUE 4 as revised).
