    35	pass.** Criteria are in §7. ESTIMATE: fact(3) at S=1 drops from 7.7 h to 2.0-2.7 h with 3-4
    36	parallel nodes; at S=8 from about 1.2 h (linear) to about 25 min (tree). The blocker is not the
    37	circuit; it is the 48 GB peak clause of SRC-011 and the serial `heavy.lock`, which must become
    38	an aggregate cap and a concurrent lock class (E11).
